cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the associated article and this software."

type: software

title: "SPR Kinetics and Affinity Analysis Scripts"

abstract: >-
  Python scripts for processing Surface Plasmon Resonance (SPR) data:
  (1) kinetics preprocessing, reference subtraction, molecular-weight-based
  normalization and steady-state signal extraction (spr_kinetics_analysis.py),
  and
  (2) fitting of a 1:1 binding isotherm to steady-state affinity data,
  with optional Monte Carlo uncertainty estimation (spr_affinity_fit.py).

